# Vendored third-party assets and the trained model must survive a clone
# byte-for-byte. leaflet.css ships with CRLF endings and git would silently
# normalise them, so the file in a fresh clone would no longer match the
# upstream release it was verified against.
rain-nowcast/web/vendor/** -text
custom_components/rain_nowcast/www/leaflet.* -text
rain-nowcast/models/*.onnx binary
*.h5 binary
